er `name`, bookmark\n  update `title`, bookmark update `url`, and folder update `name`; each\n  invalid request returned `400` with an `error` field.\n- Valid folder and bookmark creation still returned `201`.\n- `PUT /folders/:id` with omitted `name` returned `200` and preserved the\n  existing name.\n- Benchmark T5 functional checker passed when run with the Node v22 PATH:\n  `empty_title_400`, `empty_url_400`, `valid_still_works`, and\n  `empty_folder_name`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
