\t- `npm test` attempted; Vitest reported no test files.\n    55\t- `PORT=3106 node dist/index.js` with authenticated curl checks passed:\n    56\t  default `GET /bookmarks` returned `page=1`, `limit=20`, `total=12`, `data.length=12`, and envelope keys.\n    57\t- `GET /bookmarks?page=2&limit=5` returned `page=2`, `limit=5`, `total=12`, `data.length=5`, first title `Bookmark 6`, and last title `Bookmark 10`.\n    58\t- Invalid pagination checks returned HTTP 400 for `page=0`, `page=-1`, `limit=0`, `limit=200`, and `page=abc`.\n    59\t- Auth register/login and bookmark create flows were exercised; `GET /folders` still returned an array.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
