./benchmark/runs/baseline-main-20260526/T3-folder-support/events.jsonl:37:{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' docs/stories/T2-crud-bookmarks.md\"","aggregated_output":"# T2 CRUD Bookmarks\n\n## Status\n\nimplemented\n\n## Lane\n\nnormal\n\n## Product Contract\n\nThe Bookmark Manager API persists bookmarks in `data.db` and exposes unauthenticated CRUD endpoints for the T2 slice. A bookmark has an integer `id`, required `url`, required non-empty `title`, nullable `description`, and ISO timestamp strings for `created_at` and `updated_at`.\n\n## Relevant Product Docs\n\n- `docs/product/api.md`\n- `PRODUCT_SPEC.md`\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- `POST /bookmarks` creates a bookmark and returns HTTP 201 with the created record.\n- `GET /bookmarks` returns HTTP 200 with all bookmarks as a JSON array.\n- `GET /bookmarks/:id` returns HTTP 200 with a matching bookmark or HTTP 404.\n- `PUT /bookmarks/:id` updates a matching bookmark and returns HTTP 200 or HTTP 404.\n- `DELETE /bookmarks/:id` deletes a matching bookmark and returns HTTP 204 or HTTP 404.\n- Missing `url`, missing `title`, and empty `title` on create return HTTP 400.\n- `GET /health` still returns HTTP 200 with `{ \"status\": \"ok\" }`.\n\n## Design Notes\n\n- Commands: create, update, and delete bookmark records.\n- Queries: list all bookmarks and read a bookmark by id.\n- API: `/bookmarks` collection and `/bookmarks/:id` member routes.\n- Tables: `bookmarks`.\n- Domain rules: `url` and non-empty `title` are required; `description` is nullable.\n- UI surfaces: none.\n\n## Validation\n\n| Layer | Expected proof |\n| --- | --- |\n| Unit | TypeScript build succeeds. |\n| Integration | Run server and curl all CRUD endpoints plus validation failures. |\n| E2E | Not applicable for this API-only slice. |\n| Platform | Confirm `data.db` contains the `bookmarks` table. |\n| Release | Not applicable. |\n\n## Harness Delta\n\nNone.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `npm run build` completed successfully.\n- `PORT=3102 npm start` started the compiled server.\n- Curl checks returned: `GET /health` 200, create validation failures 400, `POST /bookmarks` 201, `GET /bookmarks` 200, `GET /bookmarks/:id` 200, `PUT /bookmarks/:id` 200, `DELETE /bookmarks/:id` 204, missing `GET /bookmarks/:id` 404, missing `DELETE /bookmarks/:id` 404.\n- `sqlite3 data.db '.schema bookmarks'` showed the expected `bookmarks` table.\n- `npm test` was attempted; Vitest exited with code 1 because no test files exist.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
